zus2snf","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31410},{"id":1787095160484,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:23","timestamp":1787099015385,"roundId":"round_1787098996653_fnzus2snf","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"听话，腿再分开一点…对…让我进去得更深一点。现在，闭上眼睛，专心感受。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31411},{"id":1787095160485,"text":"我的中指，顺着你流出来的水，慢慢地往里探。","rawContent":"我的中指，顺着你流出来的水，慢慢地往里探。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:23","timestamp":1787099015387,"roundId":"round_1787098996653_fnzus2snf","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31412},{"id":1787095160486,"text":"很紧。","rawContent":"很紧。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:23","timestamp":1787099015390,"roundId":"round_1787098996653_fnzus2snf","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31413},{"id":1787095160487,"text":"明明已经这么湿了，里面却还是又紧又烫，贪心地想把我的手指吞下去。","rawContent":"明明已经这么湿了，里面却还是又紧又烫，贪心地想把我的手指吞下去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:23","timestamp":1787099015394,"roundId":"round_1787098996653_fnzus2snf","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31414},{"id":1787095160488,"text":"别夹这么紧，放松。","rawContent":"别夹这么紧，放松。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:23","timestamp":1787099015397,"roundId":"round_1787098996653_fnzus2snf","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36